{"id":"665757","name":"紫苏酱菜","author":"飞舞的夏花","authorId":"240007","desc":"","cover":"images/665757/cover.jpg","ingredients":{"main":[{"name":"紫苏叶","amount":"200克"}],"sub":[{"name":"大蒜","amount":"一颗"},{"name":"线椒","amount":"适量"},{"name":"小米辣","amount":"适量"}]},"steps":[{"step":1,"desc":"将小米辣，线椒，大蒜切碎备用。","img":"images/665757/step_1.jpg"},{"step":2,"desc":"紫苏叶用盐水浸泡后洗净，切碎。","img":"images/665757/step_2.jpg"},{"step":3,"desc":"锅中热油，将辣椒，蒜末炒香。","img":"images/665757/step_3.jpg"},{"step":4,"desc":"加入紫苏叶翻炒。","img":"images/665757/step_4.jpg"},{"step":5,"desc":"加入生抽，盐，味精，耗油翻炒收汁。","img":"images/665757/step_5.jpg"},{"step":6,"desc":"最后加入高度白酒，芝麻翻炒均匀。","img":"images/665757/step_6.jpg"},{"step":7,"desc":"放凉就可以装罐保存了。","img":"images/665757/step_7.jpg"}],"tips":"来自 美食天下  的作品\n\t\t\t\t\n\t\t\t\t\t使用的厨具：炒锅\n\t\t\t\t\n\t\t\t\t\t所属分类：","attrs":{}}